        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: উঁকি দেওয়া",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "উঁকি দেওয়া — ũki deoyā — \"to peep; to peek\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আওয়াজ শুনে আমি জানালা দিয়ে উঁকি দিলাম। āoyāj shune āmi jānālā diye ũki dilām. I heard a noise and peeped out of the window."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): সেই শিশু জানালা দিয়ে উঁকি দিল, sei shishu jānālā diye ũki dilô."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "উঁকি দেওয়া (ũki deoyā) puts উঁকি — filed in CDIAL 1938 under Sanskrit udīkṣā, 'looking up', where a Bengali uki, 'careful watching', appears — before দেওয়া: to give a peep."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
