          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "প্রদর্শন করা (prôdôrshôn kôrā) puts প্রদর্শন — Sanskrit pradarśana, pra 'forth' with darśana 'a seeing', so a showing (Monier-Williams), taken over whole — before করা, to do: to put something on show."
